{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"五中全會召開之際　央視播放系列節目解讀習近平黨建思想\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CN-XI-261026-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】中共五中全會召開之際，央視播放系列節目，解讀總書記習近平的黨建思想。</p><p>央視報道，旗下的《焦點訪談》由周一起推出三集系列節目，闡述「習近平黨建思想」。</p><p>中共在6月召開全國黨建工作座談會，首次提出「習近平黨建思想」，明確堅持黨中央集中統一領導的最高原則。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:27.279929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:24:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:19.898575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:27.702716+00:00","content_hash":"1be5904bb5da937044d92f5dd82c98e3e209c4097df36eb25c81699180028981","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:27.279929+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}